hadiths[56]{hadithnumber,text}:
"54","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) majlis mein logon ko hadees suna rahey they ke Aap key paas aik dehaati aaya aur us ne kaha: Qiyaamat kab hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (apni) baat kartey rahey. To baaz logon ne kaha: Aap ne jo us ne kaha suna magar jo us ne kaha usey naapasand kya. Aur baaz ne kaha: Balke Aap ne suna hi nahi, yahan tak ke jab Aap apni baat poori kar chukey to farmaya: Qiyaamat key baarey mein poochhney wala kahaan hai? Us ne kaha: Main hun Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Phir jab amaanat zaaya kar di jaey to Qiyaamat ka intezaar karo. Us ne kaha: Uska zaaya karna kaisey hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jab maamla naaehil key supurd kar diya jaey to Qiyaamat ka intezaar karo. (Bukhari: 59)"
"55","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik safar mein jo ham ne kya tha ham se peechey reh gaey. To Aap ne hamein paa liya jabke namaz ne hamein takleef mein daal diya tha aur ham wuzu kar rahey they. To ham apne pairon par masah karney lagey. To Aap ne buland aawaaz se pukaara: Aidiyon key liye aag se kharaabi ho! Do ya teen martaba. (Bukhari: 60)"
"56","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak darkhton mein aik darkht hai jiskey pattey nahi girtey aur beshak wo Musalman ki misaal hai. To mujhey batao wo kaunsa hai? To log jangli darkhton mein (soch mein) pad gaey. Abdullah ne kaha: Aur merey dil mein aaya ke wo khajoor hai, to main sharma gaya. Phir unhon-ne kaha: Hamein bataaiye wo kaunsa hai Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Wo khajoor hai. (Bukhari: 61)"
"57","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jabke ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath masjid mein baithey they ke aik aadmi oont par sawaar daakhil hua. To us ne usey masjid mein bithaaya phir usey baandha, phir un se kaha: Tum mein se Muhammad kaun hain? Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey darmiyaan tek lagaaey huey they. To ham ne kaha: Ye gorey rang key tek lagaaey huey aadmi. To us aadmi ne Aap se kaha: Ae Abdul Muttalib key betey! To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Main ne tumhey jawaab diya. To us ne kaha: Beshak main tum se poochhney wala hun aur sawaal mein tum par sakhti karunga, to apne dil mein mujh par naaraaz na hona. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo jee chaahey poochho. To us ne kaha: Main tumhey tumharey Rab aur tum se pehley logon key Rab ka waasta deta hun, kya Allah ne tumhey tamaam logon ki taraf bhej kar bheja hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Haan. Us ne kaha: Main tumhey Allah ka waasta deta hun, kya Allah ne tumhey hukm diya hai ke ham din aur raat mein paanch namazein padhein? Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Haan. Us ne kaha: Main tumhey Allah ka waasta deta hun, kya Allah ne tumhey hukm diya hai ke ham saal key is mahiney key rozey rakkhein? Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Haan. Us ne kaha: Main tumhey Allah ka waasta deta hun, kya Allah ne tumhey hukm diya hai ke ye sadqa hamaarey maaldaaron se lo aur useh hamaarey faqeeron mein taqseem karo? To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Haan. To us aadmi ne kaha: Main us (deen) par imaan laaya jo tum laaey ho, aur main apne peechhey apni qaum walon ka numaenda hun, aur main Zamaam bin Saalba hun jo Bani Saad bin Bakr ka bhai hai. (Bukhari: 63)"
"58","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna khat dey kar aik aadmi ko bheja aur usey hukm diya ke wo use Bahrein key bade aadmi ko pahuncha dey. To Bahrein key bade aadmi ne use Kisra ko pahuncha diya. Phir jab us ne use padha to us ne use phaad daala. Unhon-ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unkey liye baddua ki ke wo poori tarah tukdey tukdey kar diye jaaein. (Bukhari: 64)"
"59","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik khat likha ya likhney ka iraada kya. To Aap se kaha gaya ke wo koi khat nahi padhtey magar jo mohar shuda ho. To Aap ne chaandi ki aik mohar bana li jis par naqsh tha: Muhammad Rasulullah. Goya main uski safedi Aap key haath mein dekh raha hun. (Bukhari: 65)"
"60","[AI-translation] Abu Waaqid Laisi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jabke Aap masjid mein baithey they aur log Aap key sath they ke teen aadmi aey. To do Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf aey aur aik chala gaya. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo donon Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas khadey huey. Un mein se aik ne halqey mein jagah dekhi to us mein baith gaya. Aur doosra unkey peechey baith gaya. Aur teesra peeth mor kar chala gaya. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faarigh huey to farmaya: Kya main tumhey teen aadmiyon key baarey mein na bataun? Un mein se aik ne Allah ki panaah li to Allah ne usey panaah di. Aur doosra sharmaaya to Allah us se sharmaaya. Aur doosra us ne munh moda to Allah ne us se munh mod liya. (Bukhari: 66)"
"61","[AI-translation] Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne oont par baithey aur aik insaan ne uski nakeel ya lagaam pakdi hui thi. Unhon-ne kaha: Ye kaunsa din hai? To ham khaamosh rahey yahan tak ke ham ne gumaan kya ke Aap uska uskey naam key siwa koi naam rakkhengey. Aap ne farmaya: Kya ye Yaum-un-Nahr nahi hai? Ham ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To ye kaunsa mahina hai? To ham khaamosh rahey yahan tak ke ham ne gumaan kya ke Aap usey uskey naam key siwa kisi naam se pukaarengey. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya ye Zul Hijja nahi hai? Ham ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To beshak tumharey khoon aur tumharey maal aur tumhari izzatein tumharey darmiyaan haraam hain jaisey tumharey is din ki hurmat tumharey is mahiney mein tumharey is shehar mein hai. Haazir (shakhs) ghaaeb (shakhs) tak pahuncha dey. To beshak haazir shayed us tak pahunchaaey jo us se zyada yaad rakhney wala ho. (Bukhari: 67)"
"62","[AI-translation] Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein dinon mein waaz ki khabar letey they, ham par uktaahat ki naapasandgi se. (Bukhari: 68)"
"63","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aasaani karo aur mushkil na karo, aur khushkhabri do aur nafrat na dilaao. (Bukhari: 69)"
"64","[AI-translation] Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jis key sath Allah bhalai chahta hai use deen mein samajh ataa karta hai. Aur beshak main taqseem karney wala hun aur Allah deney wala hai. Aur ye ummat hamesha Allah key hukm par qaem rahegi, unhey jo unki mukhaalifat karega nuqsaan na pahunchaaeyga yahan tak ke Allah ka hukm aa jaey. (Bukhari: 71)"
"65","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas they ke Aap key paas khajoor ka guda laaya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak darkhton mein aik darkht hai jiski misaal Musalman ki misaal jaisi hai. To main ne kehna chaaha: Wo khajoor hai. Phir main qaum mein sab se chhota tha to main khaamosh raha. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo khajoor hai. (Bukhari: 72)"
"66","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hasad nahi magar do (aadmiyon) mein: Aik aadmi jisey Allah ne maal diya phir use haq mein kharch karney par laga diya, aur aik aadmi jisey Allah ne hikmat di to wo uskey sath faisla karta hai aur usey sikhaata hai. (Bukhari: 73)"
"67","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey apne sath lagaa liya aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Use Kitaab sikha. (Bukhari: 75)"
"68","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main gadhi par sawaar aaya jabke main us din balooghat key qareeb tha, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Mina mein baghair deewar key (sutrey key) namaz padha rahey they. To main baaz saf key saamney se guzra aur gadhi ko charney key liye chhor diya aur saf mein daakhil ho gaya. To mujh par iska inkaar na kya gaya. (Bukhari: 76)"
"69","[AI-translation] Mehmood bin Rabee (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik kulli yaad rakhi jo Aap ne merey munh mein ki thi jabke main paanch saal ka bachcha tha, aik dol se (paani ley kar). (Bukhari: 77)"
"70","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Uski misaal jo Allah ne mujhey dey kar bheja hai, hidaayat aur ilm mein se, zyada baarish ki misaal jaisi hai jo zameen ko pahunchi. To un mein se umda zameen thi jis ne paani qabool kya to us ne bahut ghaas aur sabza ugaaya. Aur un mein se sakht zameen thi jis ne paani rok liya to Allah ne uskey zariye logon ko faeda diya to unhon-ne piya aur pilaaya aur kheti ki. Aur un mein se aik doosrey giroh ko pahunchi jo sirf chatyal maidaan hain, na paani roktey hain aur na ghaas ugaatey hain. To ye uski misaal hai jo Allah key deen mein samajh rakhta hai aur usey faeda deta hai jo Allah ne mujhey dey kar bheja hai, to us ne seekha aur sikhaaya. Aur uski misaal hai jis ne uskey sath sar nahi uthaaya aur Allah ki hidaayat ko qabool na kya jiskey sath main bheja gaya hun. (Bukhari: 79)"
"71","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Qiyaamat ki nishaaniyon mein se hai ke ilm utha liya jaaeyga aur jaahaalat qaaem ho jaaeygi aur sharaab pi jaaeygi aur zina zaahir ho jaaeyga. (Bukhari: 80)"
"72","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main tumhey zaroor aik hadees sunaaunga jo merey baad tumhey koi nahi sunaaeyga. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Qiyaamat ki nishaaniyon mein se hai ke ilm kam ho jaaeyga aur jaahaalat zaahir ho jaaeygi aur zina zaahir ho jaaeyga aur auratein zyada ho jaaengi aur mard kam ho jaaengey yahan tak ke pachaas auraton ka aik nigraan hoga. (Bukhari: 81)"
"73","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jabke main soya hua tha merey paas doodh ka pyaala laaya gaya. To main ne piya yahan tak ke beshak main seraabi ko apne naakhunon mein nikalta hua dekhta hun, phir main ne apna bacha hua Umar bin Khattab ko de diya. Unhon-ne kaha: To Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne uski kya taabeer ki? Aap ne farmaya: Ilm ki. (Bukhari: 82)"
"74","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hajjat-ul-Wada mein Mina mein logon key liye khadey huey jabke wo Aap se poochh rahey they. To Aap key paas aik aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: Mujhey khabar na thi to main ne zibah karney se pehley sar mundwa liya? To Aap ne farmaya: Zibah karo aur koi harj nahi. Phir doosra aaya aur us ne kaha: Mujhey khabar na thi to main ne rami karney se pehley zibah kar liya? Aap ne farmaya: Rami karo aur koi harj nahi. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kisi cheez key baarey mein jo aagey ya peechey ki gai ho poochha na gaya magar Aap ne farmaya: Karo aur koi harj nahi. (Bukhari: 83)"
"75","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ilm utha liya jaaeyga aur jaahaalat aur fitney zaahir ho jaaengey aur Harj bahut ho jaaeyga. Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Aur Harj kya hai? To Aap ne apne haath se aisa kya aur use tedha kya, goya Aap qatl muraad letey they. (Bukhari: 85)"
"76","[AI-translation] Asma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Aisha key paas aai jabke wo namaz padh rahi thein. To main ne kaha: Logon ka kya haal hai? To unhon-ne aasmaan ki taraf ishaara kya. Phir log khadey they. To unhon-ne kaha: SubhanAllah! Main ne kaha: (Kya koi) nishaani hai? To unhon-ne apne sar se ishaara kya yaani haan. To main khadi hui yahan tak ke mujhey behoshi ne gher liya. To main apne sar par paani daalney lagi. Phir Allah ki hamd-o-sana Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ki aur us par sana ki, phir farmaya: Jo cheez mujhey nahi dikhaai gai thi magar main ne use apne is maqaam mein dekh liya yahan tak ke Jannat aur aag (bhi). To meri taraf wahi ki gai ke tum apni qabron mein aazmaaey jaaogey Maseeh Dajjaal key fitney jaisa ya qareeb, mujhey nahi maloom Asma ne un donon mein se kaunsi kahi, fitna. Kaha jaaeyga: Tumhara is aadmi key baarey mein kya ilm hai? Phir momin ya yaqeen rakhney wala, mujhey nahi maloom Asma ne un donon mein se kaunsi kahi, to wo kahega: Wo Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain, hamaarey paas waazeh dalael aur hidaayat ley kar aey to ham ne qabool kya aur pairwi ki. Wo Muhammad hain, teen martaba. To kaha jaaeyga: Nek (haalat mein) so jao. Ham jaan chukey ke beshak tum us par yaqeen rakhney waley they. Aur munaafiq ya shak karney wala, mujhey nahi maloom Asma ne un donon mein se kaunsi kahi, to wo kahega: Main nahi jaanta, main ne logon ko kuchh kehtey huey suna to main ne wahi keh diya. (Bukhari: 86)"
"77","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Haaris (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Abu Ihaab bin Aziz ki beti se nikaah kya. To unkey paas aik aurat aai aur us ne kaha: Beshak main ne Uqba ko aur jis se us ne nikaah kya usey doodh pilaaya hai. To Uqba ne us se kaha: Mujhey nahi maloom ke tum ne mujhey doodh pilaaya hai aur na tum ne mujhey khabar di. To wo Madina mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf sawaar ho kar gaey aur Aap se poochha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaisey (nikah baaqi raheyga) jabke kaha jaa chuka! To Uqba ne usey juda kar diya aur us ne uskey siwa shohar se nikaah kar liya. (Bukhari: 88)"
"78","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main aur Ansaar mein se mera aik padosi Bani Umayya bin Zaid mein they jo Madina key baalaai hisson mein se hai. Aur ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaney jaaney mein baari baandhtey they. Wo aik din aata aur main aik din aata. Phir jab main aata to us din ki wahi aur uskey siwa ki khabar ley kar aata. Aur jab wo aata to isi tarah karta. To mera Ansaari saathi apni baari key din aaya aur us ne mera darwaaza zor se khatkhataya aur kaha: Kya wo yahaan hai? To main ghabra gaya aur uski taraf nikla. To us ne kaha: Aik bada maamla pesh aa gaya hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To main Hafsa key paas daakhil hua to wo ro rahi thein. To main ne kaha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhey talaaq dey di hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Mujhey nahi maloom. Phir main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas daakhil hua aur main ne khadey khadey kaha: Kya Aap ne apni biwiyon ko talaaq dey di hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. To main ne kaha: Allahu Akbar! (Bukhari: 89)"
"79","[AI-translation] Abu Masood Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Fulaan hamein jo lambi (namaz) padhaata hai uski wajah se main namaz ko shayed hi paata hun. To main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kisi naseehat mein us din se zyada sakht ghusb mein nahi dekha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae logon! Beshak tum (logon ko) door bhagaaney waley ho. Phir jo logon ko namaz padhaaey to use halki (namaz) padhaani chaahiye. Beshak un mein beemaar aur kamzor aur haajatmand hota hai. (Bukhari: 90)"
"80","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Khaalid Juhani (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik aadmi ne gumshuda cheez key baarey mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Uski bandhan ya farmaya: Uskey bartan aur uski theli pehchaan lo, phir uska aik saal tak elaan karo, phir us se faeda uthao. Phir agar uska maalik aa jaey to use usey dey do. Us ne kaha: To gumshuda oont (ka kya hukm hai)? To Aap ghussa huey yahan tak ke Aap ki gaalein surkh ho gaein ya farmaya: Aap ka chehra surkh ho gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Aur tumhey us se kya (kaam)? Uskey sath uski mashk aur uskey jootey hain. Wo paani par aata hai aur darkht char ta hai. To use chhor do yahan tak ke use uska maalik mil jaey. Us ne kaha: To gumshuda bakri (ka kya hukm hai)? Aap ne farmaya: Wo tumhaarey liye ya tumharey bhai key liye ya bhediye key liye hai. (Bukhari: 91)"
"81","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aisi cheezon key baarey mein poochha gaya jinhey Aap naapasand kartey they. Phir jab Aap par (sawaalaat) zyada kiye gaey to Aap ghussa huey. Phir logon se kaha: Mujh se jo jee chaahey poochho. Aik aadmi ne kaha: Mera baap kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara baap Huzaafa hai. Phir doosra khada hua aur us ne kaha: Mera baap kaun hai Ya Rasulullah? To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara baap Saalim hai jo Shaiba ka aazaad karda ghulaam hai. Phir jab Umar ne Aap key chehrey mein jo tha dekha to kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak ham Allah se tauba kartey hain. (Bukhari: 92)"
"82","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap jab salaam kartey to teen martaba salaam kartey, aur jab koi baat kehtey to use teen martaba dohraatey yahan tak ke Aap se samajh li jaati. (Bukhari: 94)"
"83","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen (qism key log) hain jinhey do ajr hain: Aik aadmi Ahle Kitaab mein se jo apne Nabi par imaan laaya aur Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par imaan laaya, aur ghulaam mamlok jab Allah ka haq aur apne aaqaaon ka haq ada karey, aur aik aadmi jiskey paas londi thi to us ne usey adab sikhaaya aur usey achhi tarah adab sikhaaya aur usey ilm sikhaaya aur usey achhi tarah sikhaaya, phir usey aazaad kya aur us se nikaah kar liya, to usey do ajr hain. (Bukhari: 97)"
"84","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley jabke Aap key sath Bilaal they. To Aap ne gumaan kya ke Aap ne auraton ko nahi sunaaya. To Aap ne unhey waaz kiya aur unhey sadqey ka hukm diya. To aurat baali aur angoothi daalney lagi, aur Bilaal apne kapdey key kinaarey mein letey they. (Bukhari: 98)"
"85","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Qiyaamat key din Aap ki shafaat se sab se zyada khushnaseeb kaun hoga? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abu Hurairah! Mujhey gumaan tha ke tum se pehley mujh se is hadees key baarey mein koi nahi poochhega, jo main ne tumhari hadees ki hirs dekhi hai. Qiyaamat key din meri shafaat se sab se zyada khushnaseeb wo hoga jis ne dil ya jaan se khaalis (niyat key sath) La ilaaha illallah kaha. (Bukhari: 99)"
"86","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak Allah ilm ko aisa nahi uthaata ke use bandon se kheench kar utha ley. Lekin ilm ko ulema key uth jaaney key sath uthaata hai, yahan tak ke jab koi aalim baaqi na rakkhey to log jaahil sardaar bana lengey. Phir un se poochha jaaeyga to wo baghair ilm key fatwa dengey, to wo gumraah hongey aur gumraah karengey. (Bukhari: 100)"
"87","[AI-translation] Aur Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Teen (bachchey) jo balooghat ko nahi pahunchey. (Bukhari: 102)"
"88","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis se hisaab liya gaya use azaab diya jaaeyga. Aisha ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Kya Allah Taala nahi farmata: (To anqareeb us se aasaan hisaab liya jaaeyga)? Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo to peshi hai, lekin jis se hisaab mein poochh gachh ki gai wo halaak ho jaaeyga. (Bukhari: 103)"
"89","[AI-translation] Abu Shuraih (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Fatah key agley din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aik baat kehtey huey suna jo merey donon kaanon ne suni aur merey dil ne yaad rakhi aur meri donon aankhon ne dekha jab Aap ne use kaha. Aap ne Allah ki hamd ki aur us par sana ki, phir farmaya: Beshak Makkah ko Allah ne hurmat wala banaaya hai aur logon ne use hurmat wala nahi banaaya. To kisi shakhs key liye jo Allah aur Aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai halaal nahi ke wo us mein khoon bahaaey aur na us mein darkht kaatey. Phir agar koi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key us mein qitaal ki wajah se rukhsat ley to kaho: Beshak Allah ne apne Rasool ko ijazat di thi aur tumhey ijazat nahi di. Aur beshak mujhey us mein din ki aik ghadi ijazat di gai thi, phir aaj uski hurmat kal ki hurmat ki tarah laut aai hai. Aur haazir ghaaeb tak pahuncha dey. (Bukhari: 104)"
"90","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujh par jhoot na baandho, beshak jo mujh par jhoot baandhey to wo aag mein daakhil ho. (Bukhari: 106)"
"91","[AI-translation] Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo mujh par wo kahey jo main ne nahi kaha to wo aag mein apna thikaana bana ley. (Bukhari: 109)"
"92","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Merey naam par naam rakkho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakkho. Aur jo mujhey khwaab mein dekhey to beshak us ne mujhey dekha, beshak shaitaan meri soorat mein zaahir nahi hota. Aur jo mujh par jaan boojh kar jhoot baandhey to wo aag mein apna thikaana bana ley. (Bukhari: 110)"
"93","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne Makkah se qatl ya haathi ko rok diya, aur un par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur mominon ko ghaalib kar diya. Khabardaar! Beshak wo mujh se pehley kisi key liye halaal na hui aur merey baad kisi key liye halaal na hogi. Khabardaar! Beshak wo merey liye din ki aik ghadi halaal hui. Khabardaar! Beshak meri is ghadi mein wo haraam hai. Uskey kaantey na ukhaadey jaaein aur na uskey darkht kaatey jaaein aur na uski giri hui cheez uthaai jaey magar elaan karney waley key liye. Phir jo qatl kya jaey to wo do behtar raayon mein se aik ka haqdaar hai: Ya to diyat di jaey ya maqtool key ghar waley badla lein. To Yaman walon mein se aik aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: Merey liye likh dijiye Ya Rasulullah! To Aap ne farmaya: Abu fulaan key liye likh do. To Quraish mein se aik aadmi ne kaha: Izkhar key siwa Ya Rasulullah! Beshak ham use apne gharon aur qabron mein istemaal kartey hain. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Izkhar key siwa, Izkhar key siwa. (Bukhari: 112)"
"94","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka dard sakht ho gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Merey paas kitaab laao, main tumharey liye kitaab likh dun jiskey baad tum gumraah na hogey. Umar ne kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par dard ghaalib aa gaya hai aur hamaarey paas Allah ki Kitaab hai, hamein kaafi hai. To unhon-ne ikhtelaaf kya aur shor bahut ho gaya. Aap ne farmaya: Merey paas se uth jao, aur merey paas jhagadna munaasib nahi hai. To Ibn Abbas nikley aur kehtey they: Poori museebat wo museebat hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key aur Aapki kitaab key darmiyaan haael hui. (Bukhari: 114)"
"95","[AI-translation] Umm Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik raat jaagey aur farmaya: SubhanAllah! Aaj raat kya fitney naazil huey hain aur kya khazaane kholay gaey hain! Hujron waliyon ko jagao. To duniya mein kapdey pehenney wali bahut si aakhirat mein nangi hongi. (Bukhari: 115)"
"96","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni zindagi key aakhir mein hamein Isha ki namaz padhaai. Phir jab Aap ne salaam phera to khadey huey aur farmaya: Kya tum ne apni is raat ko dekha? Beshak is se sau saal key sar par jo zameen ki peeth par hai us mein se koi baaqi na rahega. (Bukhari: 116)"
"97","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main apni khaala Maimoona bint Haaris (Raziallahu anha) key ghar raat raha jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey paas unki raat mein they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Isha ki namaz padhi, phir apne ghar aey aur chaar rakatein padhein, phir so gaey, phir uthay, phir farmaya: Chhota bachcha so gaya, ya aisa kalimat jo us jaisa ho, phir uthay. To main Aap key baaen taraf khada hua to Aap ne mujhey apne daaen taraf kar liya. To Aap ne paanch rakatein padhein, phir do rakatein padhein, phir so gaey yahan tak ke main ne Aap key kharraatey suna, phir namaz key liye nikley. (Bukhari: 117)"
"98","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak log kehtey hain: Abu Hurairah ne bahut (hadeesein bayan kein). Aur agar Allah ki Kitaab mein do aayatein na hotein to main koi hadees bayan na karta. Phir wo tilaawat kartey: (Beshak jo log chhupaatey hain jo ham ne waazeh dalael aur hidaayat mein se naazil kya) uskey qaul (Rehem karney wala) tak. Beshak Muhaajireen mein se hamaarey bhaiyon ko baazaaron mein len den mashghool rakhta tha, aur Ansaar mein se hamaarey bhaiyon ko unkey maalon mein kaam mashghool rakhta tha. Aur Abu Hurairah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath pet bhar khaaney par rehtey they aur haazir hotey jahaan wo haazir na hotey aur yaad rakhtey jo wo yaad na rakhtey. (Bukhari: 118)"
"99","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main Aap se bahut hadees sunta hun jo main bhool jaata hun. Aap ne farmaya: Apni chaadar bichhao. To main ne bichhaai. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap ne apne donon haathon se utha kar daala, phir farmaya: Use lapet lo. To main ne lapet liya. Phir uskey baad main kuchh na bhoola. (Bukhari: 119)"
"100","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se do bartan yaad kiye. Un mein se aik ko to main ne phaela diya. Aur doosra agar main phaelaaun to ye halq kaat diya jaaeyga. (Bukhari: 120)"
"101","[AI-translation] Jareer (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hajjat-ul-Wada mein un se farmaya: Logon ko khaamosh karao. To Aap ne farmaya: Merey baad kaafir ho kar na lautna ke tum mein se baaz baaz ki gardanein maarney lagein. (Bukhari: 121)"
"102","[AI-translation] Ubayy bin Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Musa Nabi Bani Israel mein khateeb ho kar khadey huey. To un se poochha gaya: Logon mein sab se zyada jaanney wala kaun hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Main sab se zyada jaanney wala hun. To Allah ne un par itaab kya jab unhon-ne ilm ko uski taraf na lautaaya. To Allah ne unki taraf wahi ki ke merey bandon mein se aik banda do samandaron key milney ki jagah par hai jo tum se zyada jaanney wala hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae merey Rab! Aur wo kaisey milaga? To un se kaha gaya: Tokri mein machhli rakkho. Phir jab tum use kho do to wo wahein hai. To wo chaley aur unkey sath unka jawaamard Yusha bin Noon chala aur unhon-ne tokri mein machhli rakkhi. Yahan tak ke jab wo chattaan key paas they to unhon-ne apne sar rakkhey aur so gaey. To machhli tokri se nikal gai (aur us ne samandar mein apna raasta surang bana liya). Aur Musa aur unkey saathi key liye taajjub tha. To wo apni baaqi raat aur apna din chaley. Phir jab subah hui to Musa ne apne saathi se kaha: (Hamaara subah ka khaana lao, beshak ham ne apne is safar se takleef paai hai). Aur Musa ne takleef ka ehsaan na paaya tha yahan tak ke wo us jagah se aagey badh gaey jiskey baarey mein unhey hukm diya gaya tha. To unkey saathi ne un se kaha: (Kya Aap ne dekha jab ham chattaan ki taraf aey to beshak main machhli bhool gaya aur mujhey shaitaan key siwa kisi ne nahi bhulaaya). Musa ne kaha: (Yehi hai jo ham chaahtey they, to wo apne qadmon key nishaanon par wapas lautey). Phir jab wo chattaan tak pahunchey to aik aadmi kapdey mein lapta hua tha ya farmaya: Us ne apne kapdey se khud ko dhaanpa hua tha. To Musa ne salaam kya. To Khizr ne kaha: Aur tumhaari zameen mein salaam kahaan (se aaya)? To unhon-ne kaha: Main Musa hun. To unhon-ne kaha: Bani Israel key Musa? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: (Kya main tumhaari pairwi karun is par ke tum mujhey us mein se sikhaao jo tumhey bhalai mein se sikhaaya gaya hai). Unhon-ne kaha: (Beshak tum merey sath sabr ki taaqat na rakkhogey). Ae Musa! Beshak main Allah key ilm mein se aik ilm par hun jo us ne mujhey sikhaaya hai, use tum nahi jaantey. Aur tum aik ilm par ho jo us ne tumhey sikhaaya hai, use main nahi jaanta. (Unhon-ne kaha: Anqareeb tum mujhey agar Allah ne chaaha sabr karney wala paaogey aur main tumhaarey kisi hukm ki naafarmaani na karunga). To wo donon samandar key kinaarey paidal chaley, unkey paas kashti na thi. To unkey paas se aik kashti guzri to unhon-ne un se kaha ke wo un donon ko sawaar kar lein. To Khizr pehchaaney gaey to unhon-ne un donon ko baghair mazduri key sawaar kar liya. To aik chidiya aai aur kashti key kinaarey par baithi aur samandar mein aik ya do chonch maari. To Khizr ne kaha: Ae Musa! Mera ilm aur tumhara ilm Allah key ilm mein se kam nahi hua magar is chidiya ki chonch key baraabar samandar mein. To Khizr kashti key takhton mein se aik takhtey ki taraf badhey aur use ukhaad diya. To Musa ne kaha: Aisi qaum jis ne hamein baghair mazduri key sawaar kya tum unki kashti ki taraf badhey aur use phaad daala taake us walon ko gharq kar do? (Unhon-ne kaha: Kya main ne nahi kaha tha ke beshak tum merey sath sabr ki taaqat na rakkhogey. Unhon-ne kaha: Mujhey us par na pakdo jo main bhool gaya aur mujh par merey maamley mein tangi na daalo). To Musa ki pehli (ghalti) bhool thi. To wo donon chaley, phir aik ladka bachchon key sath khel raha tha to Khizr ne usey sar key upar se pakda aur apne haath se uska sar ukhaad diya. To Musa ne kaha: (Kya tum ne paak jaan ko baghair jaan key qatl kar diya). (Unhon-ne kaha: Kya main ne tum se nahi kaha tha ke beshak tum merey sath sabr ki taaqat na rakkhogey). (To wo donon chaley yahan tak ke jab wo aik basti walon key paas aey to unhon-ne uskey rehne walon se khaana manga to unhon-ne un donon ki mehmaan nawaazi se inkaar kar diya. To unhon-ne us mein aik deewaar paai jo girna chaahti thi to use seedha kar diya). Khizr ne apne haath se (use) seedha kya. To Musa ne un se kaha: (Agar tum chaahtey to us par mazduri letey. Unhon-ne kaha: Ye merey aur tumharey darmiyaan judai hai). Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Musa par rehem farmaaey. Ham chaahtey they ke kaash wo sabr kartey yahan tak ke hamein un donon key maamley mein se sunaaya jaata. (Bukhari: 122)"
"103","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Allah key raastey mein qitaal kya hai? Beshak ham mein se koi ghussey mein qitaal karta hai aur (koi) ghairat mein qitaal karta hai? To Aap ne uski taraf apna sar uthaaya. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Aap ne uski taraf apna sar sirf isliye uthaaya ke Aap khadey they. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo isliye qitaal karey taake Allah ka kalima buland ho to wo Allah key raastey mein hai. (Bukhari: 123)"
"104","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jabke main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Madina key veeraan hisson mein chal raha tha jabke Aap apne paas mojood khajoor ki shaakh par tek lagaaey huey they. To Aap Yahood key aik giroh key paas se guzrey. To un mein se baaz ne baaz se kaha: Us se Rooh key baarey mein poochho. Aur baaz ne kaha: Us se na poochho, wo us mein aisi cheez na laaey jo tum naapasand kartey ho. To baaz ne kaha: Ham zaroor us se poochhengey. To un mein se aik aadmi khada hua aur us ne kaha: Ae Abul Qaasim! Rooh kya hai? To Aap khaamosh rahey. To main ne kaha: Beshak unki taraf wahi ki jaa rahi hai. To main khada ho gaya. Phir jab Aap se (wo kefiyat) door hui to Aap ne farmaya: (Aur wo tum se Rooh key baarey mein poochhtey hain. Kaho: Rooh merey Rab key hukm se hai aur tumhey ilm mein se magar thoda diya gaya hai). (Bukhari: 125)"
"105","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jabke Muaz Aap key peechey kajawey par sawaar they, Aap ne farmaya: Ae Muaz bin Jabal! Unhon-ne kaha: Haaazir hun Ya Rasulullah aur madad key liye tayyaar hun! Aap ne farmaya: Ae Muaz! Unhon-ne kaha: Haaazir hun Ya Rasulullah aur madad key liye tayyaar hun! Teen martaba. Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs gawahi dey ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain, apne dil se sachchaai key sath, magar Allah use aag par haraam kar deta hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main iski logon ko khabar na dun to wo khush ho jaaein? Aap ne farmaya: Tab wo bharosa kar lengey. Aur Muaz ne uskey sath gunaah key khauf se maut key waqt khabar di. (Bukhari: 128)"
"106","[AI-translation] Umm Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Umm Sulaim Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaein aur unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Allah haq se nahi sharmaata. To kya aurat par ghusl hai jab wo ehtelaam dekhey? Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab wo paani dekhey. To Umm Salma ne dhaanpa yaani apna chehra, aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur kya aurat ehtelaam dekhti hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, tumhara daayaan haath khaak aalood ho. To uska bachcha us jaisa kyun hota hai. (Bukhari: 130)"
"107","[AI-translation] Ali bin Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main bahut mazi aaney wala aadmi tha. To main ne Miqdaad bin Aswad ko hukm diya ke wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochhein. To unhon-ne Aap se poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Us mein wuzu hai. (Bukhari: 132)"
"108","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi masjid mein khada hua aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aap hamein kahaan se ehraam baandhney ka hukm detey hain? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Madina waley Zul Hulaifa se ehraam baandhein, aur Shaam waley Juhfa se ehraam baandhein, aur Najd waley Qarn se ehraam baandhein. Aur Ibn Umar ne kaha: Aur wo gumaan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur Yaman waley Yalamlam se ehraam baandhein. Aur Ibn Umar kehtey they: Main ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se samajh na saka. (Bukhari: 133)"
"109","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Aap se poochha: Ehraam baandhney wala kya pehney? To Aap ne farmaya: Na qameez pehney aur na amaama aur na shalwaar aur na burnus, aur na aisa kapda jisey wars ya zaafraan laga ho. Phir agar usey jootey na milein to moozey pehen ley aur unhey kaat dey yahan tak ke wo takhnon se neechey ho jaaein. (Bukhari: 134). Kitaab-ul-Wuzu."
